    "text": "The negation of the statement&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
